chief would have to go forward. Jack came trotting back. We're in sight now.

210
00:12:29,718 --> 00:12:31,638
All right, we'll get as close as we can.

211
00:12:31,638 --> 00:12:34,679
He followed Jack toward the castle where the ground rose slightly. On their left

212
00:12:34,679 --> 00:12:37,959
