00:12:55,719 --> 00:12:59,799
perhaps 15 long continued the island out into the sea. There lay another of those

219
00:12:59,799 --> 00:13:03,318
pieces of pink squareness that underllay the structure of the island. This side

220
00:13:03,318 --> 00:13:06,840
of the castle, perhaps 100 ft high, was the pink bastion they had seen from the

221
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:10,280
mountaintop. The rock of the cliff was split, and the top littered with great

