00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:19,559
You're a hunter. Jack went red. I know.

225
00:13:19,559 --> 00:13:24,639
All right. Something deep in Ralph spoke for him. I'm chief. I'll go. Don't

226
00:13:24,639 --> 00:13:29,959
argue. He turned to the others. You hide here. wait for me. He found his voice

