232
00:13:50,280 --> 00:13:54,280
Well, so long. He forced his feet to move until they had carried him out onto

233
00:13:54,280 --> 00:13:59,559
the neck of land. He was surrounded on all sides. by chasms of empty air. There

234
00:13:59,559 --> 00:14:03,079
was nowhere to hide, even if one did not have to go on. He paused on the narrow

235
00:14:03,079 --> 00:14:06,600
neck and looked down. Soon, in a matter of centuries, the sea would make an

236
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:10,280
island of the castle. On the right hand was the lagoon, troubled by the open

