00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:52,200
the mountain. That's where they saw the beast. The beast won't be there. What

281
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:56,200
else can we do? The others, waiting in the grass, saw Jack and Ralph unharmed

282
00:16:56,200 --> 00:16:59,398
and broke cover into the sunlight. They forgot the beast in the excitement of

283
00:16:59,398 --> 00:17:02,439
exploration. They swarmed across the bridge and soon were climbing and

284
