he watched the mountain. He clenched his fist and beat hammer-wise on the red

287
00:17:13,559 --> 00:17:18,239
wall at his right. His lips were tightly compressed and his eyes yearned beneath the fringe of

288
00:17:18,239 --> 00:17:23,799
hair. "Smoke!" he sucked his bruised fist. "Jack, come on." But Jack was not

289
00:17:23,799 --> 00:17:27,079
there. A knot of boys making a great noise that he had not noticed were

290
