up the cliff. "Stop it! Stop it!" His voice struck a silence among them.

293
00:17:38,120 --> 00:17:42,200
"Smoke!" A strange thing happened in his head. Something flittered there in front

294
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:47,318
of his mind like a batwing obscuring his idea. Smoke. At once the ideas were back

